    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25093" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">istoc</span></b> , adv.
		istic, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>thither</i>, <i>that way</i>, <i>yonder</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">quemquam istoc ad vos intromittere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut.
					Truc. 4, 2, 6</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">accede illuc: nimium istoc abisti,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ter.
					Ad. 2, 1, 15</span></i>
			; v. also istic.</div>
